<title>USA: Reckson files shelf $250 mln common, pref.</title>
<headline>Reckson files shelf $250 mln common, pref.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckson Associates Realty Corp filed Tuesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration for up to $250 million in common stock, preferred stock and warrants.</p>
<p>The commercial real estate company said net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including repayment of debt, development or acqusitions of additional properties and the renovation, expansion and improvement of existing properties.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
</text>
